H5900.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living before Israel's Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:15; 
son of: Caleb (H3612); 
brother of: Achsah (H5915), Elah (H0425J) and Naam (H5277) 
§ Iru = "watch"
son of Caleb and grandson of Jephunneh

H5901.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:7; 
son of: Bela (H1106A); 
brother of: Ard (H0714H), Naaman (H5283H), Ezbon (H0675H), Uzzi (H5813I), Uzziel (H5816I), Jerimoth (H3406), Addar (H0146H), Gera (H1617I), Abihud (H0031), Abishua (H0050H) and Ahoah (H0265) 
§ Iri = "belonging to a city"
a Benjamite, son of Bela

H5907H.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 22:12; 
son of: Micaiah (H4320); 
father of: Elnathan (H0494K); also called Abdon at 2 Chroniques 34:20; 
Also named: av.don (עַבְדּוֹן "Abdon" H5658K)
§ Achbor = "mouse"
1) father of king Baal-hanan of Edom
2) son of Michaiah and contemporary of king Josiah of Judah

H5915G.def:
A woman living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at Josué 15:16; 
daughter of: Caleb (H3612); 
sister of: Iru (H5900), Elah (H0425J) and Naam (H5277); married to Othniel (H6274)
§ Achsah = "ankle chain" or "anklet"
the daughter of Caleb and wife of Caleb's brother Othniel to whom she was given as a reward for capturing Debir

H5915H.def:
A woman of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:49; 
daughter of: Caleb (H3612H); 
sister of: Hur (H2354), Jesher (H3475), Shobab (H7727H), Ardon (H0715), Mareshah@1 Chroniques 2:42 (H4337), Haran (H2771B), Moza (H4162), Gazez (H1495), Jahdai (H3056), Sheber (H7669), Tirhanah (H8647), Shaaph (H8174H) and Sheva (H7724)
§ Achsah = "ankle chain" or "anklet"
the daughter of Caleb and wife of Caleb's brother Othniel to whom she was given as a reward for capturing Debir

H5925.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:36; 
son of: Zophah (H6690); 
brother of: Suah (H5477), Harnepher (H2774), Beri (H1275), Imrah (H3236), Bezer (H1221H), Hod (H1936), Shamma (H8037H), Shilshah (H8030), Ithran (H3506H) and Beera (H0878); 
father of: Arah (H0733), Hanniel (H2592H) and Rizia (H7525); also called Ulla at 1 Chroniques 7:39; 
Another name of shu.al (שׁוּעָל "Shual" H7777B) 
§ Ulla = "yoke"
an Asherite, head of a family in his tribe

H5935.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:23; 
son of: Shobal (H7732); 
brother of: Manahath (H4506B), Ebal (H5858B), Shepho (H8195) and Onam (H0208) 
§ Alian or Alvan = "tall"
a Horite, son of Shobal

H5964H.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:8; 
son of: Becher (H1071); 
brother of: Zemirah (H2160), Joash (H3135), Eliezer (H0461I), Elioenai (H0454I), Omri (H6018H), Jeremoth (H3406H), Abijah (H0029K) and Anathoth (H6068H)
§ Alameth or Alemeth = "covering"
1) a Benjamite, son of Jehoadah or Jerah and descended from Saul through Jonathan
2) a town in Benjamin

H5964I.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:36; 
son of: Jehoaddah (H3085); 
brother of: Azmaveth (H5820H) and Zimri (H2174H)
§ Alameth or Alemeth = "covering"
1) a Benjamite, son of Jehoadah or Jerah and descended from Saul through Jonathan
2) a town in Benjamin

H5992I.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exode 6:18; 
son of: Kohath (H6955); 
brother of: Amram (H6019), Hebron (H2275B) and Uzziel (H5816); 
father of: Korah (H7141I), Nepheg (H5298), Zichri (H2147) and Shelomith (H8019A)
Another name of yits.har (יִצְהָר "Izhar" H3324)
§ Amminadab = "my kinsman is noble"
1) son of Ram or Aram and father of Nahshon or Naasson and an ancestor of Jesus; father-in-law of Aaron
2) a Kohathite Levite and chief of the sons of Uzziel
3) a Levite, son of Kohath; also 'Izhar'
